  <ModuleMeta><Name>Shipments Domain</Name><Description>Shipment aggregate with status workflow and events.</Description><Category>DDD</Category><Stability>Stable</Stability></ModuleMeta>
  <Principles><Principle id="P1" name="Single Responsibility"><Description>Shipment aggregate tracks physical shipping: status workflow (pending → ready → shipped → delivered), tracking number, carrier, and shipping address. Each transition publishes domain events.</Description><Rationale>Aggregate ensures shipment invariants: tracking number required before ship, address validated before marking ready.</Rationale></Principle></Principles>
  <Features><Feature id="F1" name="Shipments " type="core">Ship Without Tracking: Marking a shipment as shipped without a tracking number.</Feature></Features>
  <AntiPatterns><AntiPattern id="AP1" name="Require tracking number before setting status to s" severity="high"><Avoid>Proceeding without validation or proper configuration.</Avoid><BetterApproach>Always validate inputs and follow documented patterns.</BetterApproach></AntiPattern></AntiPatterns>
